# Allowlist: the image only needs sources, lockfile, templates and the docker/ scripts.
# (Keeps node_modules, .git, infra/ incl. cdk.out, bench data and local indexes out of the build context.)
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!templates
!docker
src/**/*.test.ts
**/.DS_Store
**/.kopt
